<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 1.67 bln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves fall FIM 1.67 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for January 31 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to January 23  SPFC :</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 62,009	 63,674</p>
<p> Money market intervention    14,277	 11,558</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,907	  1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,265	  2,265</p>
<p> Total assets		     87,308	 86,230</p>
<p>In the previous week to January 23 reserves rose by 11.5 billion markka.</p>
<p>	 --Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 24</p>
</text>
